  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Home economics</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UKR hush&#xE5;llsekonomisk utb</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For five years, Sida has financed a successful project training in home economics for rural women in Russia. Swedish counterpart SFEAS now want to start up a similar project in Ukraine. During three days in april 1999 there will be a preparatory seminar for elaboration of projectplan for the project in Kiev, Ukraine.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xF6;rberedande seminarium f&#xF6;r hush&#xE5;llsekonomisk utbildning i Kiev Ukraina, under tre dagar i april 1999. Ett liknande projekt har under 5 &#xE5;r p&#xE5;g&#xE5;tt i Ryssland vilket fr&#xE4;mst riktat sig till kvinnor p&#xE5; landsbygden. Nu kommer f&#xF6;ruts&#xE4;ttningarna f&#xF6;r ett liknande projekt i Ukraina att diskuteras p&#xE5; seminariet. Svensk genomf. part: SFEAs</narrative>
  </description>
